        "pkcontributionId": 64377,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 298,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "<p>Mesonephric remnants are embryonic remnants of mesonephric duct, and mesonephric hyperplasia is their benign proliferation.</p>",
